        <mxCell id="s1-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap" value="SECTION 1 DATA FLOW:&#xa;1. Orchestrator reads build config, invokes tools via fork()+execve()&#xa;2. gcc compiles each .c → .o (one execve() per file)&#xa;3. ar bundles .o into .a static archives&#xa;4. ld links .o + .a + system .so → final binaries&#xa;&#xa;Key: Each tool invocation = one execve() syscall&#xa;System .so = shared libraries from /usr/lib/ (e.g. libc, libcurl)" vertex="1">
