        <mxCell id="s3-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=0" value="SECTION 3 DATA FLOW:&#xa;1. AdgParser reads ADG, uses bomsh_omnibor_treedb&#xa;   to resolve gitoid hashes → file paths&#xa;   Output: static_inputs[] (list of .o/.a paths)&#xa;&#xa;2. VendoredVersionDetector scans source directories&#xa;   for version strings (configure.ac, headers)&#xa;   Output: pkg_versions{} (name → version map)&#xa;&#xa;3. collect_dynamic_libs.py runs ldd on each binary,&#xa;   then dpkg -S to find apt packages&#xa;   Output: dyn_libs[] (pkg name, version, .so path)&#xa;&#xa;4. SpdxEmitter combines all 3 data structures into&#xa;   SPDX 2.3 JSON with packages + relationships&#xa;&#xa;5. spdx_visualize.py reads SPDX JSON, extracts&#xa;   graph data (nodes=packages, edges=relationships),&#xa;   classifies nodes by type (root/static/dynamic/build),&#xa;   computes BFS depth for layout, generates interactive&#xa;   D3.js force-directed graph with zoom/pan, tooltips,&#xa;   click-to-highlight, and collapsible dependency trees" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="240" x="790" y="978" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yn901Q_CqHxwS0rFUU9Y-2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="     collect_dynamic_libs.py&#xa;&#xa;Runs: ldd &lt;binary&gt;&#xa;Parses output to get .so paths:&#xa;→ /lib/x86_64.../libc.so.6&#xa;→ /usr/lib/.../libcurl.so.4&#xa;&#xa;Runs: dpkg -S &lt;path&gt;&#xa;Maps each .so → apt package&#xa;+ version:&#xa;→ libc6: /lib/.../libc.so.6&#xa;dpkg -s libc6 → ver 2.35" vertex="1">
